Cell["\<\
We will perform the analytic continuation for the differential equation that \
is defined for s=0.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996983472426331*^9, 
  3.9969835075603313`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"953d95e1-6ad6-4db9-a6b6-\
0073392120d2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"deS0", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<<", "\"\<HolonomicContinuation/s0_pseudo_diffeq_26.m\>\""}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9969199651621857`*^9, 3.9969199737930593`*^9}, {
  3.9969202252974033`*^9, 3.996920236969462*^9}, {3.9969203395378523`*^9, 
  3.9969203446212378`*^9}, {3.9971524785261803`*^9, 3.997152479891707*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e618f890-5e64-48a3-afb6-409dcd92aec0"],

Cell["\<\
More precisely, we will carry it to move from s=-196 to s=-Infinity. Here we \
need the expansion for s=-196 and calculate the expansion for s=-Infinity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996983512183074*^9, 
  3.9969835885050793`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"22873a0c-521a-4ced-bf9c-\
f5edf4515d7f"],

